# BUG-006 — Product Not Added to Cart

## Bug Type
Functional Bug

## Module
Product / Cart

## Severity
High

## Priority
High

## Steps to Reproduce
1. Open the Products page.
2. Select any available product.
3. Click Add to Cart.
4. Open Cart.

## Expected Result
The selected product should appear in the cart.

## Actual Result
The product does not appear in the cart after clicking Add to Cart.

## Status
Open

